# JSON text. toJson value encodes a value: a non-empty list of [String,value]
# pairs, a record and a HashMap with string keys become objects keyed by each
# key's text, other lists arrays, Bool True/False, integers exact numbers,
# Floats numbers; prettyJson encodes it indented by two spaces. fromJson text
# decodes one: objects become their [key,value] pairs (o "status" looks one
# up), arrays lists, numbers Int or Float, null [].
